WEBVTT

27:03.334 --> 27:05.584
Moreover, it's not enough if
you declare that you've changed.

27:05.709 --> 27:07.792
What if she's married by now?

27:07.875 --> 27:08.875
-Exactly!
-Hey!

27:08.959 --> 27:09.959
Why do you manifest negative things?

27:10.917 --> 27:13.000
Y'all may not know how much I love her.

27:14.292 --> 27:15.167
But my aunt knows.
